{"sourceUrl":"https://nxy.gxu.edu.cn/info/1078/5026.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.113023+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://nxy.gxu.edu.cn/info/1078/5026.htm","html":"<div> <p></p><div>\n\n\n\n<section>\n<article>\n<p><span>关于</span><span>广西大学农学院和亚热带农业生物资源保护与利用国家重点实验室联合举办202</span><span>5</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营活动</span><span>的</span><span>通知</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生之间的学术文化交流，增进对</span><span>广西大学农学院和亚热带农业生物资源保护与利用国家重点实验室</span><span>的了解，我院</span><span>联合</span><span>亚热带农业生物资源保护与利用国家重点实验室</span><span>拟于</span><span>202</span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>2-15</span><span>日举办</span><span>“2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动。</span></p>\n<p><span>一、</span><span>招生人数：</span><span>50</span><span>人</span></p>\n<p><span>二、</span><span>选拔条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>. </span><span>拥护中国共产党，具有坚定的社会主义理想信念，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康，诚实守信，学风端正，对攻读广西大学研究生有兴趣，有较强的科研潜力，有志于从事相关科研工作；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>. </span><span>国内有推荐免试条件的高校</span><span>农学、园艺、农业资源与环境、植物保护等相关专业的</span><span>三年级本科生（</span><span>2026</span><span>应届毕业生）；</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>. </span><span>学习成绩优异，本科前三年（或前五学期）总评成绩排名在本校同年级本专业前</span><span>30%</span><span>之内；或各科成绩加权分</span><span>70</span><span>以上，专业排名不在本专业前</span><span>30%</span><span>，但在其他方面有优异表现者，如有相关科研成果（需提供相关材料复印件）等亦可申请；</span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>. </span><span>英</span><span>语水平良好（达到国家四</span><span>/</span><span>六级水平（</span><span>425</span><span>分以上）或</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>GRE</span><span>等考试成绩优秀者；</span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span>. </span><span>科研成果突出者可优先考虑。</span></p>\n<p><span>三</span><span>、申请</span><span>流程</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>. </span><span>网上报名</span></p>\n<p><span>拟申请本</span><span>院</span><span>夏令营的同学，</span><span>请于</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日-</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>将以下申请材料</span><span>(按下列</span><span>标题顺序排列，</span><span>合并在一个PDF文件中</span><span>，</span><span>文件命名格式：</span><span>学校+专业+姓名</span><span>)打包发送至邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:chenyzhi@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>chenyzhi@163.</span><span> </span><span>com</span></a><span>。</span><span>（逾期将不再接收报名材料）</span></p>\n<p><span>（1）</span><span>广西大学</span><span>2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span><span>（附件）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（2）</span><span>本科阶段学习成绩单证明材料（截至申请日所能提供的成绩单，由学校教务部门盖章）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（3）</span><span>前五个学期总评成绩排名的证明材料（由所在学院出具证明）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（4）</span><span>外语水平证明材料，如国家英语四、六级考试，以及TOEFL/IELTS/GRE等能够体现外语水平的成绩证明；</span></p>\n<p><span>（5）</span><span>本人第二代居民身份证、学生证扫描件各1份</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（6）</span><span>学籍认证报告一份；</span></p>\n<p><span>（7）</span><span>科研成果证明材料（如论文发表、专利、软著及大学生创新创业项目立项公示等，论文附发表刊物的封面、目录、正文首页，若未正式发表，附录用通知证明）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（8）</span><span>其他证明材料（如各类获奖证书）；</span></p>\n<p><span>其中材料的</span><span>（1）、（2）</span><span>项为签字\\盖章后的扫描件。</span></p>\n<p><span>注：申请人提交的全部申请材料应保证其真实性与准确性。</span><span>如有弄虚作假，取消入营资格，并通报申请人所在院校。</span><span>申请材料不全将不予受理；所提交材料不退还。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>. </span><span>审核录取</span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日后为材料审核阶段，不再接受报名。入</span><span>选人员将通过邮件形式通知，请及时关注邮件信息。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>. </span><span>营员报到</span></p>\n<p><span>请营员携带身份证和学生证按时到</span><span>广西大学农</span><span>学院进行报到。</span></p>\n<p><span>四</span><span>、</span><span>活动形式</span></p>\n<p><span>广西大学农学院和亚热带农业生物资源保护与利用国家重点实验室</span><span>2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营活动采用线下方式进行。</span></p>\n<p><span>五</span><span>、夏令营日程安排</span></p>\n<table>\n\n\n\n\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>日期</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>活动内容</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>2</span><span>日</span><span>15:00-18:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>营员报到</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月1</span><span>2</span><span>日18:00-19:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>晚餐（翠苑餐厅，自助用餐）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日</span><span>8:3</span><span>0-12</span><span>:</span><span>00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>开营仪式</span><span>（</span><span>农学院306会议室</span><span>）</span><span>、</span><span>合影、专家主题报告</span><span>（</span><span>邹承武副</span><span>教授）</span><span>、</span><span>农学院概况介绍</span><span>；介绍我校研究生培养、奖学金及就业等情况；</span><span>参观</span><span>农学院</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日12:00-13:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>午餐（翠苑餐厅，自助用餐）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日</span><span>15:00-18:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专家主题报告</span><span>（</span><span>徐秋涛</span><span>教授，</span><span>生物育种中心</span><span>；</span><span>贾海锋教授</span><span>）、</span><span>座谈交流、</span><span>综合面试</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13</span><span>日18:00-19:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>晚餐（翠苑餐厅，自助用餐）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7月14日8:30-12:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>参观广西亚热带农科新城</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日12:00-13:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>午餐</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span>15</span><span>:</span><span>0</span><span>0-1</span><span>8</span><span>:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专家主题报告（张积森教授，国重室107会议室）、参观国重室、</span><span>合影</span><span>、</span><span>营员评选</span><span>、营员结业典礼</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日1</span><span>8</span><span>:00-1</span><span>9</span><span>:00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>晚</span><span>餐（翠苑餐厅，自助用餐）</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月1</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>离营</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span>六</span><span>、优秀营员评选</span></p>\n<p><span>在夏令营活动期间，学院将开展优秀营员的选拔考核工作。</span></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>选拔考核的内容</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）学生个人展示：通过</span><span>PPT</span><span>或其他形式展示科研能力与基础条件，</span><span>5</span><span>分钟（成绩占比</span><span>60%</span><span>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）综合面试：（成绩占比</span><span>40%</span><span>）。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>选拔考核成绩的运用</span></p>\n<p><span>学院根据选拔考核总成绩确定优秀营员名单，并颁发</span><span>“</span><span>优秀营员证书</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>营员结业证书</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>七</span><span>、生活管理</span></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>夏令营活动期间农学院将为参营人员提供在南宁的食宿（对南宁市本地学校学生不提供住宿），交通费自理；</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>参营人员应按时参加活动，遵守有关规章制度和夏令营的要求与纪律；</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>夏令营活动期间学生人身、财务安全由本人负责，请注意安全。</span></p>\n<p><span>八</span><span>、其他说明</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>本活动方案为暂定计划，并根据教育部、广西壮族自治区以及学校相关要求及时调整。具体安排请关注后续通知；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>欢迎各高校</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生积极报名，可来电咨询相关信息。</span></p>\n<p><span></span><span>联系地址：广西南宁市大学东路</span><span>100</span><span>号广西大学农学院研究生办公室（农学院主楼进门左边</span><span>127</span><span>办公室）</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：陈老师</span><span>、张老师</span></p>\n<p><span>联系电话：</span><span>0771-3270813</span><span>    0771-3237773</span></p>\n<p><span>邮箱：</span><a href=\"mailto:chenyzhi@l63.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>chenyzhi@l63.com</span></a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>附件</span><span></span><span>：</span><a href=\"https://me.gxu.edu.cn/gxdxjxxy2022yxdxsxlysqb.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>广西大学农学院202</span><span>5</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></a></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span> </span><span>                          </span><span>   </span><span>广西大学农学院</span></p>\n<p><span> </span><span>                            2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月5</span><span>日</span></p>\n</article>\n</section>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"cb7d119a0e490b934fc6ee2278cd752893a87791c5195e7fb4c7238e2ba374c8","textLength":2058,"sourceSha256":"e61336a83452f60298e222500b1d5f6b69ad5a68cbeedafd2f3b0e6c22ec39c6","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件：广西大学农学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营申请表.docx","url":"https://nxy.gxu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1846995948&wbfileid=15054772"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-61b4cb6eb34be98b6e2c","title":"2025年广西大学农学院和亚热带农业生物资源保护与利用国家重点实验室联合举办2025年优秀大学生夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:14.113023+00:00"}
